---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
import RelatedInsight from '../../components/RelatedInsight.astro';
import DeliveryPathway from '../../components/DeliveryPathway.astro';
---

<Layout title="AI Strategy & Transformation" description="From 'we should do something with AI' to a strategy your board can fund.">

  <PageHero
    label="Services"
    title='From "we should do something with AI" to a strategy your <span class="text-ms-green-400">board can fund.</span>'
    subtitle="Most companies don't fail at AI because the technology isn't ready. They fail because they never built the bridge between opportunity and execution."
  />

  <DeliveryPathway
    headline="Strategy connects the business decision to delivery."
    intro="Strategy is part of Scan, Audit, Build, and Program. We define the workflow, establish the case for change, and build or coordinate the system with clear responsibilities for your team and ours. Each engagement has its own agreed scope and output."
  />

  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12">The decisions behind a useful AI investment.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Choose work worth changing.</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-6">The Scan compares candidate workflows in one business area. It gives you a recommendation about where to begin, the evidence behind it, and the prerequisites for the next move.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-400">
            <li>→ Business value, current friction, feasibility, and risk</li>
            <li>→ Knowledge available and decisions that need human judgment</li>
            <li>→ Reasons to proceed, test internally, or stop</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-5">Make the decision buildable.</h3>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-6">The Audit examines one selected workflow in depth. We map how the work runs, design the future workflow, and establish the business case and operating rules before a Build.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-400">
            <li>→ Systems, data, access, and integration requirements</li>
            <li>→ Build or buy choices and an implementation plan</li>
            <li>→ Measurement baseline, ownership, and decision rights</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 bg-ms-dark-800 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl p-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Carry the strategy into the work.</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">AI Workflow Build covers implementation, testing, training, and handover within the agreed scope. The AI-Native Organization Program extends proven patterns across teams with governance and shared infrastructure. A Business AI Workshop can support alignment when needed.</p>
        <a href="/services/workshops" class="inline-block mt-5 text-ms-green-400 font-semibold hover:text-ms-green-300 transition">Explore the Business AI Workshop →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Differentiators -->
  <section class="bg-ms-dark-900">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-12">What makes this different.</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">We've built AI products.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">Not just strategy decks. Our founder led Beethoven X, one of the most ambitious AI creativity projects in history. We know what it takes to go from idea to something real.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">We build and hand over.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">We build within the agreed scope and coordinate specialist partners where needed. Testing, training, documentation, and clear ownership help your team operate and maintain the system.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3">We speak executive, not engineer.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400">You'll never hear us say "fine-tune a transformer model on your proprietary corpus." You'll hear "here's what this means for your margin."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <RelatedInsight
    href="/insights/the-halo-organization"
    title="The Halo Organization: Why Your AI Pilots Keep Failing"
    description="Why AI transformation depends on organizational design, not just technology selection."
  />

  <CTA placement="strategy-footer" />

</Layout>
